---
const projects = [
  {
    name: "Warp Lab",
    tagline: "Spatial audio made visible.",
    description:
      "An experimental wearable interface that turns surrounding sound into a reactive spatial flight environment.",
    status: "Community Preview",
  },
  {
    name: "Apsis Core",
    tagline: "The center of gravity.",
    description:
      "Local model orchestration, tools, retrieval, memory, and agent workflows running on hardware you control.",
    status: "In Development",
  },
  {
    name: "Visual Forge",
    tagline: "Local generative media.",
    description:
      "A local-first environment for image, video, and creative generation workflows.",
    status: "Experimental",
  },
  {
    name: "Luminaria",
    tagline: "Ambient intelligence, differently.",
    description:
      "A research project exploring how information can become part of an environment instead of another app window.",
    status: "Research",
  },
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Apsis is a local-first AI engineering project exploring private intelligence, spatial computing, generative media, and experimental interfaces."
    />

    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/apsisai-mark.svg" />\n    <meta name="theme-color" content="#070a0d" />\n\n    <title>ApsisAI — Less Cloud. More Gravity.</title>

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #070a0d;
        --bg-soft: #0c1116;
        --panel: rgba(17, 25, 32, 0.7);
        --panel-hover: rgba(21, 32, 40, 0.92);

        --text: #ecf3f0;
        --muted: #91a29b;
        --faint: #5e6f68;

        --accent: #49b8bc;
        --accent-soft: rgba(73, 184, 188, 0.15);
        --line: rgba(73, 184, 188, 0.18);

        --max-width: 1180px;
	}
		.featured-warp {
  padding-top: 40px;
}

.warp-feature {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
  gap: 24px;

  margin-top: 48px;

  border: 1px solid var(--line);

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(73, 184, 188,0.06),
      rgba(73, 184, 188,0.015)
    );
}

.warp-copy {
  padding: 48px;
}

.warp-copy h2 {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.warp-tagline {
  margin: 12px 0 0;

  color: var(--accent);

  font-size: 1rem;
}

.warp-description {
  max-width: 620px;

  margin-top: 24px;

  color: var(--muted);

  font-size: 1.02rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.warp-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;

  margin-top: 32px;
}

.warp-visual {
  min-height: 420px;

  display: grid;
  place-items: center;

  position: relative;

  overflow: hidden;

  border-left: 1px solid var(--line);

  background:
    radial-gradient(
      circle at center,
      rgba(73, 184, 188,0.07),
      transparent 60%
    );
}

.warp-radar {
  position: relative;

  width: min(320px, 72%);
  aspect-ratio: 1;

  border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 188,0.3);
  border-radius: 50%;

  box-shadow:
    0 0 40px rgba(73, 184, 188,0.05),
    inset 0 0 40px rgba(73, 184, 188,0.04);

  overflow: hidden;
}

.radar-ring {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 50% auto auto 50%;

  border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 188,0.16);
  border-radius: 50%;

  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
}

.ring-1 {
  width: 32%;
  height: 32%;
}

.ring-2 {
  width: 62%;
  height: 62%;
}

.ring-3 {
  width: 88%;
  height: 88%;
}

.radar-line {
  position: absolute;

  background: rgba(73, 184, 188,0.1);
}

.radar-line.horizontal {
  left: 0;
  top: 50%;

  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
}

.radar-line.vertical {
  top: 0;
  left: 50%;

  width: 1px;
  height: 100%;
}

.radar-center {
  position: absolute;

  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;

  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;

  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);

  border-radius: 50%;

  background: var(--accent);

  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(73, 184, 188,0.8);
}

.contact {
  position: absolute;

  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;

  border-radius: 50%;

  background: var(--accent);

  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(73, 184, 188,0.65);
}

.contact-a {
  left: 66%;
  top: 28%;
}

.contact-b {
  left: 26%;
  top: 62%;
}

.contact-c {
  left: 72%;
  top: 70%;
}

.radar-sweep {
  position: absolute;

  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;

  width: 50%;
  height: 2px;

  transform-origin: left center;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(73, 184, 188,0.65),
      transparent
    );

  animation: sweep 6s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes sweep {
  from {
    transform: rotate(0deg);
  }

  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .warp-feature {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .warp-visual {
    border-left: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .warp-copy {
    padding: 34px 26px;
  }

  .warp-visual {
    min-height: 320px;
  }
}
      

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(
            circle at 65% -10%,
            rgba(73, 184, 188, 0.08),
            transparent 40%
          ),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #070a0d 0%, #090d11 100%);

        color: var(--text);
        font-family:
          Inter,
          ui-sans-serif,
          system-ui,
          -apple-system,
          BlinkMacSystemFont,
          "Segoe UI",
          sans-serif;

        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      body::before {
        content: "";
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;

        background-image:
          linear-gradient(
            rgba(73, 184, 188, 0.025) 1px,
            transparent 1px
          ),
          linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            rgba(73, 184, 188, 0.025) 1px,
            transparent 1px
          );

        background-size: 48px 48px;

        mask-image:
          linear-gradient(
            to bottom,
            rgba(0,0,0,0.65),
            transparent 75%
          );
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .shell {
        width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max-width));
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;

        padding: 28px 0;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;

        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      .brand-logo {
        display: block;
        width: 44px;
        height: auto;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(73, 184, 188, 0.18));
      }

      .brand-name {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        font-weight: 650;
        letter-spacing: 0.035em;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 26px;

        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      nav a {
        transition: color 160ms ease;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 78vh;

        display: grid;
        align-items: center;

        padding: 80px 0 100px;
      }

      .hero-inner {
        max-width: 930px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        margin-bottom: 24px;

        color: var(--accent);

        font-family:
          "SFMono-Regular",
          Consolas,
          "Liberation Mono",
          monospace;

        font-size: 0.77rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;

        font-size: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 9rem);
        line-height: 0.88;
        letter-spacing: -0.065em;

        font-weight: 760;
      }

      .hero-line {
        display: block;
      }

      .gravity {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 720px;

        margin: 38px 0 0;

        color: var(--muted);

        font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.45rem);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;

        margin-top: 38px;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;

        min-height: 48px;

        padding: 0 22px;

        border: 1px solid var(--line);

        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;

        transition:
          background 160ms ease,
          border-color 160ms ease,
          transform 160ms ease;
      }

      .button.primary {
        background: var(--accent);
        border-color: var(--accent);

        color: #061011;
      }

      .button.secondary {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.015);
      }

      .button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .button.secondary:hover {
        border-color: var(--accent);
        background: var(--accent-soft);
      }

      section {
        padding: 110px 0;
      }

      .section-label {
        margin-bottom: 20px;

        font-family:
          "SFMono-Regular",
          Consolas,
          "Liberation Mono",
          monospace;

        color: var(--accent);

        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 0;

        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.4rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      }

      .section-intro {
        max-width: 720px;

        margin-top: 24px;

        color: var(--muted);

        font-size: 1.08rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .principles {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 1px;

        margin-top: 60px;

        background: var(--line);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .principle {
        min-height: 220px;

        padding: 28px;

        background: var(--bg-soft);
      }

      .principle-number {
        margin-bottom: 60px;

        color: var(--faint);

        font-family:
          "SFMono-Regular",
          Consolas,
          monospace;

        font-size: 0.72rem;
      }

      .principle h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;

        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .principle p {
        margin: 0;

        color: var(--muted);

        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .projects {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;

        margin-top: 58px;
      }

      .project-card {
        position: relative;

        min-height: 280px;

        padding: 30px;

        background: var(--panel);

        border: 1px solid var(--line);

        overflow: hidden;

        transition:
          transform 180ms ease,
          border-color 180ms ease,
          background 180ms ease;
      }

      .project-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);

        border-color: rgba(73, 184, 188,0.45);

        background: var(--panel-hover);
      }

      .project-card::after {
        content: "";

        position: absolute;
        right: -70px;
        bottom: -70px;

        width: 180px;
        height: 180px;

        border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 188,0.08);
        border-radius: 50%;

        box-shadow:
          0 0 0 28px rgba(73, 184, 188,0.015),
          0 0 0 56px rgba(73, 184, 188,0.01);
      }

      .project-status {
        display: inline-block;

        margin-bottom: 42px;

        padding: 6px 9px;

        border: 1px solid var(--line);

        color: var(--accent);

        font-family:
          "SFMono-Regular",
          Consolas,
          monospace;

        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;

        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .project-card h3 {
        margin: 0;

        font-size: 1.85rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .project-tagline {
        margin-top: 8px;

        color: var(--accent);

        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }

      .project-description {
        max-width: 500px;

        margin-top: 18px;

        color: var(--muted);

        line-height: 1.65;
      }

      .closing {
        padding-bottom: 140px;
      }

      .closing-box {
        padding: 60px;

        border: 1px solid var(--line);

        background:
          linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            rgba(73, 184, 188,0.07),
            rgba(73, 184, 188,0.01)
          );
      }

      .closing-box p {
        max-width: 790px;

        margin: 24px 0 0;

        color: var(--muted);

        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
      }

      footer {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 30px;

        padding: 30px 0 50px;

        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);

        color: var(--faint);

        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .principles {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .projects {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        nav {
          display: none;
        }

        .shell {
          width: min(calc(100% - 28px), var(--max-width));
        }

        .hero {
          min-height: auto;
          padding: 100px 0;
        }

        .principles {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .closing-box {
          padding: 34px 26px;
        }

        footer {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="shell">
      <header>
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="ApsisAI home">
          <img class="brand-logo" src="/apsisai-mark.svg" alt="" />
          <span class="brand-name">ApsisAI</span>
        </a>

        <nav>
          <a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a>
          <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="hero">
          <div class="hero-inner">
            <div class="eyebrow">
              Local-first AI engineering
            </div>

            <h1>
              <span class="hero-line">Less Cloud.</span>
              <span class="hero-line gravity">More Gravity.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="lead">
              Apsis is an independent engineering project exploring private AI,
              spatial computing, generative media, wearable interfaces, and the
              systems that connect them.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button primary" href="#projects">
                Explore the Lab
              </a>

              <a
                class="button secondary"
                href="https://github.com/ridderek"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
              >
                GitHub
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="philosophy">
          <div class="section-label">Operating Principles</div>

          <h2>
            Intelligence should live closer to you.
          </h2>

          <p class="section-intro">
            Apsis explores what happens when models, personal data, sensors,
            creative tools, and experimental interfaces operate together on
            hardware you control.
          </p>

          <div class="principles">
            <article class="principle">
              <div class="principle-number">01</div>
              <h3>Local First</h3>
              <p>
                Your hardware. Your models. Your data. Cloud services can be
                useful, but they should not be mandatory.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="principle">
              <div class="principle-number">02</div>
              <h3>Modular</h3>
              <p>
                Small systems that work independently and become more capable
                when connected.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="principle">
              <div class="principle-number">03</div>
              <h3>Experimental</h3>
              <p>
                Build it. Instrument it. Break it. Learn something. Build the
                next version.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class="principle">
              <div class="principle-number">04</div>
              <h3>Human Centered</h3>
              <p>
                Technology should extend the person using it, not turn them
                into a passenger.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
          <div class="section-label">Projects</div>

          <h2>
            Systems in orbit.
          </h2>

          <p class="section-intro">
            Apsis is not one application. It is a growing collection of local
            systems, experiments, and tools designed to work independently —
            and eventually together.
          </p>

          <div class="projects">
            {projects.map((project) => (
              <article class="project-card">
                <div class="project-status">
                  {project.status}
                </div>

                <h3>{project.name}</h3>

                <div class="project-tagline">
                  {project.tagline}
                </div>

                <p class="project-description">
                  {project.description}
                </p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

		<section class="featured-warp">
  <div class="section-label">Featured Project</div>

  <div class="warp-feature">
    <div class="warp-copy">
      <div class="project-status">Community Preview</div>

      <h2>Warp Lab</h2>

      <p class="warp-tagline">
        Spatial audio made visible.
      </p>

      <p class="warp-description">
        Warp Lab turns surrounding sound into a reactive spatial flight
        environment for Rokid waveguide glasses. Direction, intensity,
        frequency, duration, and confidence are translated into visual
        objects, trails, radar contacts, and cockpit instrumentation. Head
        movement reveals layered depth, while sustained tones can quietly draw
        Sonic Constellations across the deep field.
      </p>

      <div class="warp-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="/warp">
          Explore Warp Lab
        </a>

        <a
          class="button secondary"
          href="/warp#release"
        >
          Preview Status
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="warp-visual">
      <div class="warp-radar">
        <div class="radar-ring ring-1"></div>
        <div class="radar-ring ring-2"></div>
        <div class="radar-ring ring-3"></div>

        <div class="radar-line horizontal"></div>
        <div class="radar-line vertical"></div>

        <div class="radar-center"></div>

        <div class="contact contact-a"></div>
        <div class="contact contact-b"></div>
        <div class="contact contact-c"></div>

        <div class="radar-sweep"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

        <section id="about" class="closing">
          <div class="closing-box">
            <div class="section-label">
              Why Apsis?
            </div>

            <h2>
              Built around you.
            </h2>

            <p>
              Local execution means privacy, ownership, low latency, predictable
              cost, direct access to hardware and sensors, and the freedom to
              experiment without designing every idea around someone else's API.
              Apsis is an ongoing attempt to understand what personal computing
              looks like when intelligence becomes part of the machine itself.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>
        <span>Apsis AI</span>
        <span>Less Cloud. More Gravity.</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>